\f0\b\fs48 \cf0 Welcome to the FIMI Vulnerability Hypothesis Testing Folder
\f1\b0\fs24 \
\
The data compilated here is intended to:\
\
a) Measure polarization and social trust levels 
\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\uc0\u10003 
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \
b) Create an updated Media Literacy Index 
\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\uc0\u10003 
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \
c) Measure democracy levels 
\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\uc0\u10003 
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \
d) Account for internet usage, age, social media usage, and freedom of the press 
\fs32 \cf2 \cb3 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\uc0\u10003 
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \
\
\
Data Available\
\
For Hypothesis testing\
\
1) GINI INDEX, Latest available percentage per country (Mostly 2024), by the World Bank\
2) INTERNET USAGE, Latest available percentage per country (Mostly 2024) plus a 10-year percentage increase measurement, by the World Bank\
3) WVS DATA, Q57, 62. 117, 207. for all available countries. Wave 2017_2022.\
4) POPULATION OVER 65.  The latest available percentage per country (Mostly 2024), by the World Bank.\
5) EGOV_DATA, for E-participation on the updated Media Literacy Index, by the UN Database, 2024.\
6) FITW_DATA, to match freedom and vulnerability, by FITW, 2024 levels.\
7) MOBILE, for cellphones per capita per country. Latest available percentage per country (Mostly 2024), by the World Bank.\
8) PISA RESULTS For Science, Math, and Reading comprehension, 2024.
\f2 \

\f1 on the updated Media Literacy Indexby the OECD.\
9) SCHOOL_ENROLMENT as for tertiary education levels per country, as provided by UNICEF, Latest available percentage per country (Mostly 2024),\
10) IT SKILLS, on the updated Media Literacy Index, by the ITU, 2024.\
\
The following calculations are included in the folder. \
\
\pard\tx566\tx1133\tx1700\tx2267\tx2834\tx3401\tx3968\tx4535\tx5102\tx5669\tx6236\tx6803\pardirnatural\partightenfactor0

